0..36 Comment "//! This source models string views."
37..40 Comment "//!"
41..117 Comment "//! A view lends a held string for one access. It does not own the string. A"
118..153 Comment "//! view cannot outlive its access."
154..157 Comment "//!"
158..235 Comment "//! `resume` writes a string back. `abort` preserves the held string and runs"
236..312 Comment "//! `unwind`. A region keeps a view until its scope ends. The runtime erases"
313..336 Comment "//! this static extent."
337..340 Comment "//!"
